- Business logic outside the documented scope of this page
- Tasks requiring navigation to another page or module
- Tasks requiring external resources or another application
- Multi-operation workflows or chained tasks
- Operations that cannot be completed entirely within the current page

A question about a criteria type remains in scope even if the user has not selected that type in the grid.

